'''Gunter''' was a<ref name="SC 101">{{SkeletonCrew|This Could Be a Real Adventure}}</ref> [[Gender|male]],<ref name="SC 106" /> [[human]]<ref name="EW" /> [[cyborg]]<ref name="SC 105 AD">{{SkeletonCrew|You Have a Lot to Learn About Pirates}} {{AD|Disney+}}</ref> who belonged to a [[Silvo's pirates|pirate crew]] during the [[New Republic Era]]. Originally serving under [[Captain]] [[Jod Na Nawood|Silvo]],<ref name="SC 101" /> he swore his loyalty to the new leader, [[Brutus]],<ref name="Data" /> in the aftermath of a failed [[Silvo's pirate raid|raid]] on a [[Unidentified bulk freighter (New Republic Era)|merchant freighter]],<ref name="SC 101" /> ascending to the position of [[First Mate]].<ref name="SC 105 AD" /> When Silvo later escaped from [[prison]],<ref name="SC 103">{{SkeletonCrew|Very Interesting, As an Astrogation Problem}}</ref> Gunter took part in the pursuit of the mutinied captain, ultimately arresting him on [[Lanupa]]. During [[Trial of Silvo|Silvo's trial]], Gunter remained skeptical of his promise to lead the crew to [[At Attin]], an isolated [[planet]] rumored to accommodate [[Galactic Republic|Old Republic]] [[Galactic Credit Standard|credit]] [[Old Republic Mint|mints]].<ref name="SC 106" /> However, when Silvo [[Death|killed]] Brutus to take his place,<ref name="SC 107">{{SkeletonCrew|We're Gonna Be In So Much Trouble}}</ref> Gunter did not not oppose him. During the [[Invasion of At Attin]], he commanded the crew's [[Silvo's pirate frigate|pirate frigate]] and failed to repel the [[New Republic]]'s counteroffensive.<ref name="SC 108">{{SkeletonCrew|The Real Good Guys}}</ref>

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Gunter first appeared in the [[2024]] [[Disney+]] live-action television series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'', played by [[Jaleel White]].<ref name="EW" />

